# God Mode Protocol: Governed Swarm Architecture

This plan documents the transition from fragmented "Revenue Hunter" scripts to a unified, governed swarm architecture backed by GPT-4o and Claude 3.5 Sonnet, with a self-correcting "God Mode" engine for instruction optimization.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a complete architectural pivot. Legacy components like [RevenueHunter.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/agents/RevenueHunter.ts) and `real_hyper_intelligence_v2.ts` will be deleted.

## Proposed Changes

### [Phase 1] Purge & Security

- **Deprecation**: Remove legacy and unstable swarm components.
- **Security**: Strict enforcement of `process.env.SOLANA_PRIVATE_KEY` with NEW wallet credentials.

### [Phase 2] Swarm Infrastructure

- **Dependency Update**: Standardize on OpenAI and Anthropic SDKs for brain operations.

### [Phase 5] Local-First Sovereign Brain

- **Ollama Integration**: Replace external LLM providers with local Ollama API.
- **Cost Optimization**: 100% independent, zero-cost inference.
- **Dependency**: Requires Ollama running locally with `llama3` pulled.

- #### [NEW] [llm_client.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/llm_client.ts)

  - Unified interface for multi-model reasoning (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5 Sonnet).

### [Phase 3] Swarm Brain Layer

- #### [NEW] [god_mode.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/god_mode.ts)

  - Instruction refinement engine triggered on system failure.

- #### [NEW] [orchestrator.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/orchestrator.ts)

  - Main loop for executing and verifying swarm tasks.

### [Phase 4] Control Plane

- #### [MODIFY] [server.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/server.ts)

  - Real-time log streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE).
  - Command API for Sovereign IDE interaction.

### [Phase 6.5] The Git Keeper

- **Git Manager**: Implement [GitManager](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/git_manager.ts#4-26) to allow automated commits and pushes.
- **Orchestration**: Link [GitManager](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/git_manager.ts#4-26) to the task execution loop to "save progress" after successful verification.

### [Phase 6] Sovereign Identity Layer

- **Solana Integration**: Implement a secure, decentralized identity layer using Solana wallet adapters.
- **Component**: [SovereignWallet.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/auth/SovereignWallet.tsx) providing connection context for the entire application.

### [Phase 7] Swarm CI/CD Optimization

- **GitHub Actions**: Debug and stabilize the [swarm.yml](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.github/workflows/autonomous_swarm.yml) workflow.
- **Autonomous Evolution**: Ensure "Quantum Self Evolution" correctly triggers in CI environments.

### [Phase 9] The Economic Engine

- **Financial Rails**: Install `@solana/pay` and `bignumber.js` to enable standardized crypto payments.
- **Sovereign Merchant**: Trigger Swarm to build [SolanaMerchant.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/SolanaMerchant.tsx) for QR-based USDC payments.
- **UI Integration**: Harmonize [WalletBalance](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/WalletBalance.tsx#8-45) and [SolanaMerchant](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/SolanaMerchant.tsx#12-83) in the [SovereignIDE](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/pages/SovereignIDE.jsx#14-153) dashboard.

### [Phase 9.5] The Code Vending Machine

- **Vending Logic**: Link revenue to labor by requiring payment before Swarm task execution.
- **Merchant Callback**: Add `onPaymentSuccess` trigger to [SolanaMerchant.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/SolanaMerchant.tsx).
- **Integrated Machine**: Create [CodeVendingMachine.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/components/CodeVendingMachine.tsx) to handle user input, pricing, payment, and autonomous build triggering.

### [Phase 10] Autonomous Factory Mode

- **Blueprint Engine**: Define a JSON schema for "High Value" assets.
- **Factory Loop**: Create a script to iterate through blueprints and trigger the Swarm to build standalone, sellable React components.
- **Automation**: Expose a REST endpoint to trigger production lines.

- #### [NEW] [products.json](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/products.json)

  - List of product definitions (Token Minter, Art Gallery).

- #### [NEW] [factory.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/src/swarm/factory.ts)

  - The "Production Line" logic that wraps blueprints into Swarm tasks.

